  18  *==============================================================================*
  19  * This file allows the mapping between the sets defined in the files PEP-w.GMS
  20  * and the sets used in GTAP8.1.
  21  * It also allows the creation of the different sets used in the model.
  22   
  23  * Prior to the steps below, GTAP8.1 data need to be converted into GDX files.
  24  * We first used GTAPAgg and a 1 to 1 mapping to generate HAR files.
  25  * We changed the names of two sectors set in order to avoid confusion with
  26  * regions that share the same acronyms. Therefore, "other mining" is refered to
  27  * using OTM instead of OMN (which refers to Oman in the REG set) and "Insurance"
  28  * is refered to using INS instead of ISR (which refers to Israel in the REG set).
  29   
  30  * Running GTAPAgg automatically generates a number of files, of which two are
  31  * used below: BaseData2007.har and Default.prm. The latter was renamed
  32  * Parameters2007.har.
  33  * The har2gdx facility allows converting these two files into GDX format.
  34  *==============================================================================
