1086  *==============================================================================
1087  * Projections used in PEP w-t model
1088  *==============================================================================
1089  * The following file includes data from:
1090  * Source: "The Great Shift: Macroeconomic projections for the world economy at
1091  * the 2050 horizon" CEPII Working Paper 2012-03
1092  * by Jean Foure, Agnes Benassy-Quere & Lionel Fontagne
1093  * February 2012.
1094   
1095  ** * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * **
1096  **NOTE THAT THE FOLLOWING GTAP8.1 REGIONS ARE ABSENT FROM THE PROJECTIONS**
1097  **   aze, ben, bfa, cyp, ecu, gin, hrv, nam, rwa, slv, svn, tgo, twn,    **
1098  **   xea, xer, xna, xtw, zwe                                             **
1099  ** * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * * **
1100   
1101  *$include Projection_231002.gms
1102  * Data on total and active population are expressed in thousands
1103  * Data on GDP is expressed in millions of USD
1104   
1105  PARAMETER
1106   ACT_POP(z,time)         Active population from 1980 to 2050 based on the PEP w aggregation
1107   ACT_POP_GTAP8(reg,time) Active population from 1980 to 2050 based on the GTAP8 aggregation
1108   CAB_Foure(z,time)       Implicit CAB in Foure et al projections
1109   exogro(z,time)          Exogenous growth factor for exogenously growing variables
1110   exogro_LS(z,time)       Exogenous growth factor for exogenously growing labor supply
1111   g_GDP(z,time)           GDP growth
1112   g_KS(z,time)            Capital stock growth rate
1113   g_LS(z,time)            Active population growth rate
1114   g_POP(z,time)           Population growth rate
1115   g_SDR(z,time)           Domestic savings rate growth rate
1116   GDP(z,time)             GDP projection based on the PEP w aggregation
1117   GDP_GTAP8(reg,time)     GDP from 1980 to 2050 based on the GTAP8 aggregation
1118   gdp_per_cap(z)          GDP per capita
1119   I_rate(z,time)          Investment rate - domestic savings over GDP
1120   Invest(z,time)          Investments from 1980 to 2050 based on PEP w aggregation
1121   Invest_GTAP8(reg,time)  Investments from 1980 to 2050 based on GTAP8 aggregation
1122   K_Stock_GTAP8(reg,time) Capital stock from 1980 to 2050 based on the GTAP8 aggregation
1123   K_Stock(z,time)         Capital stock from 1980 to 2050 based on the PEP w aggregation
1124   TFP(z,time)             Total factor productivity index 1980-2050 for PEP w aggregation
1125   TFP_GTAP8(reg,time)     Total factor productivity 1980-2050 for GTAP8 aggregation
1126   S_rate(z,time)          Savings rate - domestic savings over GDP
1127   Savings(z,time)         Domestic savings from 1980 to 2050 based on PEP w aggregation
1128   Savings_GTAP8(reg,time) Domestic savings from 1980 to 2050 based on GTAP8 aggregation
1129   sdr_fac(z,time)         Exogenous change factor for domestic savings rate
1130   TOT_POP(z,time)         Total population from 1980 to 2050 based on the PEP w aggregation
1131   TOT_POP_GTAP8(reg,time) Total population from 1980 to 2050 based on the GTAP8 aggregation
1132   AEEI_low(z,time)        Autonomous energy efficiency improvement
1133   AEEI_high(z,time)       Autonomous energy efficiency improvement
1134   TREND(z,time)           Value to Physical quantity
1135   CTAX_Cal(z,time)
1136   CTAX_CPS(z,time)
1137   CTAX_NZS(z,time)
1138   CTAX_61(z,time)
1139   CTAX_145(z,time)
1140   CTAX_285(z,time)
1141   CTAX_425(z,time)
1142   CTAX_565(z,time)
